00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.110
Why do you guys look so disappointed?

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.040
It's really cute!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:20.490
While we're on a smelly subject,

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.560
stop bringing my manga into the bathroom!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.960
Dengen Daioh
stop bringing my manga into the bathroom!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.690
stop bringing my manga into the bathroom!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.550
You're making the paper turn brown!

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:31.430
I'm sorry! I won't do it again,
so please put your butt away!

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:36.370
Onsokumaru appears and the
conversation just turns nasty.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:41.700
By the way, are you jumping too?

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.400
Of course, I am!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.210
I planted mine over there!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.450
Her own plant?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.090
Knowing Shinobu, she probably...

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.290
Tadaa! It's this one!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.210
W-What is that thing?!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.140
It's Pochinosuke! Isn't it a cute name?

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:25.210
That's not the point! What is with that plant?!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:29.380
Um... I don't know either.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:32.460
I just planted seeds I found in
the storage room and it grew.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:34.990
Are you sure it's not dangerous?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.600
It's absolutely not.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.500
See? It purrs. It's really cute!

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:48.810
On top of that!

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:53.110
I can jump over it with ease!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:55.410
That's cheating!

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:59.180
Now, now, no need to be so uptight.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:07.330
What's that sweet smell?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.590
Butterflies and birds came to smell it, too!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.260
Doesn't it make you feel really happy?

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.590
What is it?

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:47.870
Get a hold of yourself, Kaede!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.900
Kaede! Kaede!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.280
Onsokumaru, you don't get it at all.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:07.460
It's no longer tragic if they find
out they're not related by blood.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.690
Wait a minute!

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:18.190
I feel like I understand that eroticism,
but rather than its literary quality, there...

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.400
There... there...

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:27.210
W-W-Who is it! Who is saying
hello to my sex pistol area!?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:32.310
Onsokumaru!

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:33.910
Onsokumaru!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.750
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:42.180
I get it! You're an assassin sent to dispose of me!

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:47.190
Guys! Don't interrupt us. This is my fight.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.350
Yes! Onsokumaru!

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:50.820
Alrighty!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:55.330
It's going to be a fight-party
till morning! Bring it on!

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.270
My feelings are spinning around and around!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.810
Help me!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.810
Stop it! Stop it!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.120
You can't do this to an idol like me!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:10.850
You're going to hear from my agency!

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.350
It's got Onsokumaru in an
embarrassing Sumo wrap!

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.150
Onsokumaru's pride must be shattered!

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.120
I have no idea what's going on,
but that thing's strong!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.830
Nooo! I'm scared of manjuu!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:25.290
Hey! Pochinosuke! Let go of Onsokumaru!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.700
Onsokumaru, are you okay?

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:36.340
Damn it!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.270
What is that thing?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:42.650
My Brave Sword had no effect on it!

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.890
You didn't even use it!

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:46.920
Encyclopedia of
Strange Plants

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:49.220
Onsokumaru, this is terrible!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:54.690
That plant is a monster plant that
grows by eating everything in its path!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.990
Say what?!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.670
Apparently, back in the day,

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:02.260
they threw the seeds into an
enemy castle to destroy them.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:08.840
What? Does that mean an enemy of ours sent it?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:14.780
Dengeki Ramen Daioh
With daioh squid inside!!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.720
No! My cup noodle lid collection!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.250
My collectible anime cel!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.460
It's already destroying us!

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.660
Stop it, Pochinosuke!

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:31.820
Pochinosuke!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.900
