00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:42.110
Day after tomorrow!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.470
Pochinosuke!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.090
Pochinosuke, you idiot!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.190
Pochinosuke!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:08.830
You're giving it back?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.300
It's really gross but thanks.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.140
It's spitting out the butterflies
and birds it ate earlier.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:22.250
Meow!

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:27.810
It even ate all that?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.260
Even ninjas?!

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:38.760
That scared me! We're finally out.

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:42.500
I was wondering why there
were so few of us this episode.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.840
See? Pochinosuke said it won't do anything bad.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.580
I'll take care of it, so can it stay?

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.250
Shinobu wrapped in tentacles...

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:01.510
I think I can count on a dream
of infinite possibilities.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.880
Okay! You pass!

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.690
But a few
days later...

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.930
What's wrong, Shinobu?

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:17.660
I came to give Pochinosuke
its food, but it's gone!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.900
Maybe it ran away?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:30.020
Shinobu, there's no need to be upset.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:35.960
It's not doing anything bad, but...

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:40.460
